step Felmusk satyrs
  tip North-west of Splintertree, the Felmusk satyrs camp in the woods. Every satyr can drop horns.
  collect 5481 quest 6441

step Shadumbra
  tip Shadumbra, a shadow panther, stalks the woods around Raynewood Retreat, west of the Felmusk camp. Her head starts the next hunt quest.
  collect 16304
  accept 24 item 16304

step Tideress
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Back south-west to Mystral Lake. Tideress, a corrupted water elemental, drifts around the lake's island and under the water. She drops the Befouled Water Globe only once you have Stonetalon Standstill from Mastok; it starts a quest for Splintertree.
  collect 16408
  accept 1918 item 16408

