step Skywatcher Plateau
  only Orc,Troll,Undead,Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock,Druid
  zone Mulgore
  tip The Earthen Ring camp and its three quests stand up on Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff. Fly to Thunder Bluff if you know its flight path and take a lift down, else fly to Camp Taurajo and walk north through Mulgore; the arrow then leads round to the plateau's north end and up onto it.
  goto 40.6,22.2 "North of Thunder Bluff"

