step Freewind Post
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Ride the lift down, then follow the road east through the canyons to Freewind Post, a Tauren village on top of the mesas. Its lift is on the north side.
  getfp "Freewind Post"
  accept 4767                         -- Elu, by the wind rider master
  accept 4821                         -- Hagar Lightninghoof
  turnin 4542                         -- Cliffwatcher Longhorn
