  when group 5151
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Enraged Panther is a level 30 elite: most classes solo it at level 32, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 12946 quest 5151.1 @22.8,24.6 map 1441

