  goto 27.0,51.9 map 1441 "Screeching Roguefeather"
  level 29.49 grind 4101               -- grind on Screeching Roguefeather

step The Screeching Canyon: kill these as you meet them
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip South of Darkcloud, the harpies of Roguefeather Den. Grenka Bloodscreech (31) walks among them: thin out the harpies around her before you pull her. The Screeching Harpies, Roguefeathers and Windcallers there are Jandia's; her Stolen Freewind Supplies lie on the ground along the foot of the cliff and in the cave up on top.
  kill 4101 quest 98070.2
  kill 4104 quest 98070.3
  kill 4100 quest 98070.1
  collect 279383 x8 quest 98069 @27.0,51.9 map 1441 -- Stolen Freewind Supplies, on the ground around the den
  collect 5843 quest 1150

